{
 "section_summary": "The section opens with six pages of a continuing list of papers on Japanese overseas broadcasting, followed by a 1940 consular letter and the November issue of the Nippon Hoso Kyokai’s overseas bulletin. That issue combines broadcast schedules with articles promoting Japan’s 2,600th empire anniversary, its history and culture. A cross-reference sheet and a February 1941 consular letter follow; the December 1940 bulletin begins on page 28 and continues beyond this section.",
